* Strict-vendor adapter template for LIFeling.
* Copy to vendor_adapters.lib only after official packages are installed, declarations inspected,
* terminal order approved in model_registry.json, and each wrapper passes an ngspice smoke test.
*
* The adapter must expose these stable LIFeling wrapper interfaces:
* .subckt LIF_TLV7041_OD OUT VN INP INN VP
* .subckt LIF_TLV7031_PP OUT VN INP INN VP
* .subckt LIF_TLV9001 INP INN VP VN OUT
* .subckt LIF_TLV9041 INP INN VP VN OUT
* .subckt LIF_TS5A3166 NO COM GND IN VP
* .subckt LIF_REF3020 VIN VOUT GND
* .subckt LIF_TPD1E05U06 IO GND
* .subckt LIF_CR2032_DYNAMIC P N PARAMS: SOC=1 R0=20
* .subckt LIF_TPS610995_SWITCHING GND VOUT FB EN SW VIN
*
* It must also define exact-vendor model cards named:
* LIF_MMBT3904 LIF_BSS138 LIF_BAT54WS LIF_RB521S30 LIF_1N4148WS
* LIF_LED_RED LIF_LED_GREEN LIF_LED_BLUE
